The gray-sticker-around-the-hub tapes that came along in '89 and '90
are pretty good tapes.  But some DEC tapes with orange stickers around
the hub seem to be relabeled Memorex MRX V, which is astonishingly likely
to stick to the tape heads today.

Things are complicated because at least two different DEC distribution
centers (one in the US, one in Ireland) seem to be involved and they
are not necessarily identical.

